tokensaver's caveman voice (src/core/caveman.ts) is adapted from Caveman's
`caveman` and `ultracave` skills (skills/caveman/SKILL.md and
skills/ultracave/SKILL.md, Caveman 4.0.1, commit 2e068f7), used under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes made for tokensaver: the two skills are condensed into system-prompt
sections; their persistence and switch instructions name tokensaver's
`/tokensaver caveman` command instead of Caveman's slash commands and hooks;
the statusline, mode-tracking and stats hooks are not included. The sub-agent
report note and the terse compaction summary are tokensaver's own.

Before Caveman 3.0.0 the skill was licensed under the MIT License, and
contributions made to it then remain available under it. Its copyright and
permission notice is kept in LICENSE-MIT in this folder.

